an class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A `repeat` loop annotated with the loop invariant and the termination measure that `vcgen` reads\nfrom the `inv` and `var` arguments. It is definitionally `forIn l init f`, so the annotations are\nerased at runtime. The invariant takes the loop's `exit` flag, `false` while the loop iterates and\n`true` once it is done. The measure is the function a `Variant` is built from, so that the\nassertion language it evaluates in is the one the specification is applied at. ","docLink":"./Std/WP/Gadget/ForIn.html#Std.WP.Gadget.forInLoopWithInvariantAndVariant","kind":"def","line":141,"name":"Std.WP.Gadget.forInLoopWithInvariantAndVariant","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Std/WP/Gadget/ForIn.lean#L141-L149"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/WP/Gadget/ForIn.html#Std.WP.Gadget.forInLoopWithVariant\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">WP</span>.<span class=\"name\">Gadget</span>.<span class=\"name\">forInLoopWithVariant</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> v</span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">Fun</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m<